WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
The blade passes through the openings in all three discs.

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:05.208
One cut has picked up its disc. The other cuts reach theirs later in the turn.

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:06.167
The gates form a channel along the stack. The sidebar moves into it and clears the housing.

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.417
The discs and sidebar turn together in the carrier, driving the cam at the back.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:10.000
The cam has swung clear of the frame.
